msgstr "Uw gebruik nu"

#: includes/diagnose/_class_bill_diagnose.php:604
#: includes/diagnose/class_bill_diagnose.php:2603
msgid ""
"Your WordPress Memory Limit is too low, which can lead to critical issues on "
"your site due to insufficient resources. Promptly address this issue before "
"continuing."
msgstr ""
"Je WordPress-geheugenlimiet is te laag, wat kan leiden tot kritieke "
"problemen op je site vanwege onvoldoende bronnen. Los dit probleem "
"onmiddellijk op voordat je verdergaat."
